  "chart_description": "Figure 1 - OULAD score-prediction error bars. Two horizontal panels sharing a y-axis (Historical mean, Last score, Ridge, Random Forest, XGBoost), ordered by test MAE. Panel A: point = test MAE, whisker = 95% CI from 1000 student-clustered bootstrap resamples; Panel B: same for RMSE. n_test=38112 attempts from 6757 students (2014J holdout, unseen students). A dashed vertical rule marks the last-score baseline MAE; labels show absolute MAE and delta vs last score. Error bars are student-clustered because attempts within a student are correlated. All models are on identical test rows. Figure 2 - error distribution by assessment type: grouped box/violin plots of signed residual (prediction - actual) for TMA/CMA/Exam, including the 5th/50th/95th percentiles, so systematic over/under-prediction by assessment format is visible. Figure 3 - per-module MAE heatmap (7 modules x 5 models). Colors use a sequential scale with per-cell n annotated; the 2014J presentation contains modules unseen in training (CCC), which is expected to raise error there.",
